WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.508
This is the Back Door — the founders' room of Street Sharkz Professional. One hundred seats. This is what a seat opens.

00:00:12.508 --> 00:00:24.968
Members get in through the portal: your email, a six-digit code we send you, and your desk opens. There are no public links to this room, and no shared passes.

00:00:24.968 --> 00:00:30.468
From your desk, take the Back Door tab — and walk through.

00:00:30.468 --> 00:00:44.008
At the top, the Intel Wire: market headlines, eyes only, rolling all day. Below it, the big screen — global intel, playing right here in the room.

00:00:44.008 --> 00:00:54.116
Under the screen, the founders' stack — the Captain's own clips — and below that, the founders' floor, where the hundred talk shop.

00:00:54.116 --> 00:01:08.496
Founders hold both rooms — this one, and the Crew Deck. Keep your code to yourself; a shared pass voids the seat. Eyes only. Stay Sharked Up.

